--a messenger: to report as he has been told and to be skilled in languages of different countries; one who can adjust according to time and place;
1: M. २१५. १२-4; २५४. २४.
of Indra to तारक [page२-108+ २६] to get him ready for war after the birth of कार्त्तिकेय;
2: M. ३८. १९; १५९. २४.
of पौण्ड्रक.
3: Vi. V. ३४. 6.
